# Digital Music Store Analysis (SQL Project)

## Overview
This project analyzes a digital music store database using PostgreSQL
to generate business insights about customers, sales, artists, and genres.

## Tools Used
- PostgreSQL
- SQL (JOINs, CTEs, Window Functions, Aggregations)

## Key Insights
- Identified senior-most employee and best customer
- Found country-wise invoice trends and top revenue cities
- Determined top rock artists and long-duration tracks
- Discovered most popular genre for each country
- Calculated highest spending customer per country

## Outcome
Strengthened advanced SQL querying and data analysis skills
by solving real-world business problems using relational data.

